# Excludes these from the static-assets upload for the square-block-4d1b
# Worker (assets.directory is "." in wrangler.jsonc, i.e. the whole repo).
# Without this, node_modules (created fresh by every build's npm install)
# gets uploaded as a "site asset" and can blow past Cloudflare's 25 MiB
# per-file limit - see wrangler.jsonc for the full story. .git is excluded
# so the repo's internals are never accidentally servable publicly.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
**/.git
.claude
.wrangler
worker-payments
worker-pricing-engine
scripts
package.json
package-lock.json
firestore.rules
firebase.json
.firebaserc
.gitignore
.dev.vars*
